<title>JAPAN: Fuji PS  -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji PS  -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.70		vs	   18.83</p>
<p> Operating	  401    million	  vs	  743    million</p>
<p> Current	    362    million	  vs	  698    million</p>
<p> Net		  120    million	  vs	  296    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.48 yen	  vs	   17.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji PS Corp is a manufacturer of prestressed concrete.</p>
